<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1243"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, October 15, 2004 - 5:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks Tom for the photo, but a quick question, was this the only photo?  Whatsmore I got a link here showing the baby as you show it, and completely opposite of how you show it, meaning the beaver, which I personally believe to be a beaver with a party hat/stocking hat on, on the opposite side of the sleeper.  The cut off corner is on the otherside of the pic as well, and yes there is still a crack/cut in the picture as well?  Tell me what you think. <BR> <BR><a href="http://ghostiesannex.myphotoalbum.com/view_album.php?set_albumName=BTK" target=_top>http://ghostiesannex.myphotoalbum.com/view_album.p hp?set_albumName=BTK</a> <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1243-->
