<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1346"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Interested<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Interested<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, November 03, 2004 - 11:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have looked at the picture for along time and I see that it is a man holding a surf board.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
